XPurpose & Usage:
X
X'mgt' allows the user to examine Go board presentations edited through the 
XMacintosh(tm) programs 'Smart Go'(tm) or 'Go Explorer'(tm).   Though 'mgt'
Xpresently has no editing capabilities, the on-line material provided by a
Xrather extensive and growing database allows many hours of instructional
Xenjoyment of various studies and tutorials concerning the game of GO. 
XWith 'Smart Go' (not provided here), you can even create text files.
XThe data format will be released shortly, but you should be able to figure
Xit out by looking at the data.
X
XThis is meant to be a companion for the series, "From My Go Teacher",
Xarchived at  scam.berkeley.edu  and  milton.u.washington.edu  for ftp.
XAlso available is the Internet GO Board communications program, 'go',
Xalso by Greg Hale, which connects up two terminals in real-time
Xanywhere in the world.
X
X
XUsage: mgt <smart-go-text-file>
X
