XDISPLAYS:
X
XAll displays have in common the purpose of displaying a 'Go Tree'.
XThis is a structure which contains information created originally by
Xthe program "Smart Go".  'mgt' allows the user to traverse information
Xprovided by the instructional data file, proceeding in a forward or
Xbackward sequence, or branching down various alternative paths.  'mgt'
Xillustrates a pleasing visual interface for teaching GO.
X
XAt present, an _ASCII display is fully functional.  Later, the Macintosh
Xinterface will be added, and possibly an X-interface.
X
XData files can be obtained on the news network via the 'My Go Teacher'
Xseries in rec.games.go.  'mgt' was written by the author(s) of this series
Xfor teaching Go thru the network.
